            "sid": "1CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano n'abaana Daudi be yazaala ng'ali e Heburoni: Amunoni n'eyali omuberi, inhina nga ni Ahinoamu Omuyezireeli kwairaku Danieli, inhina nga ni Abigaili Omukarumeli ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwairaku Abusalomu, inhina nga ni Maaka mughala wa kyabazinga Talumai ow'e Geshuri kwairaku Adoniya, inhina nga ni Haggithi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwairaku Shefatia, inhina nga ni Abitali Ithureamu, ate ono inhina nga ni Egula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.4+2SA.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5:4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakyab 2:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Byom 29:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abo boonaboona omukaaga yabazaala ng'ali e Heburoni, ye yafugira okumala entangama ey'emyaka omusanvu n'emyezi omukaaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Yerusalemu Daudi oyo yafugiramu entangama ya myaka asatu n'esatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.11.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 11:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Era bano n'abaana be yazaala ng'ali eyo: Shimea, Shobabu, Nathani, Solomoni. Abo bana, inhaibwe nga ni Bathishua mughala wa Ammieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaazaala n'abaana abandi mwenda: Ibuhari, Elishama, Elifeleti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noga, Nefegi, Yafia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elishama, Eliada, ni Elifeleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi era yazaala abaana abandi abalenzi ni bakazi be ab'embali. Era yaazaala n'omwana omughala nga ni Tamari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni yazaala Rehoboamu, Rehoboamu yaazaala Abiya, Abiya yaazaala Asa, Asa yaazaala Yehoshafati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati yaazaala Yoramu, Yoramu yaazaala Ahazia, Ahazia yaazaala Yoashi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi yaazaala Amazia, Amazia yaazaala Azaria, Azaria yaazaala Yothamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yothamu yaazaala Ahazi, Ahazi yaazaala Hezekia, Hezekia yaazaala Manasse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manasse yaazaala Amoni, Amoni yaazaala Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia oyo yaazaala abaana bana: Yohanani nga n'omuberi, kwairaku Yehoiakimu, kwairaku Zedekia, kwairaku Shallumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoiakimu yaazaala abaana babiri: Yekonia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yekonia:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Bakyab 24:8-12 n'aghandi bamweta Yehoiakini, ate mu Yer 22:24 bamweta Konia.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ni Zedekia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano ni baidhukulu ba Yekonia eyatwalibwa e Babilonia nga munhage: Shealutieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malikiramu, Pedia, Shenazzari, Yekamia, Hoshama, ni Nedabia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pedia yaazaala Zerubbabeli, ni Shimei. Zerubbabeli yaazaala Meshullamu, ni Hanania, ni Shelomithi mwanhinaibwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abandi bataanu: Hashuba, Oheli, Berekia, Hasadia, ni Yushabu Hesedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanania yaazaala abaana babiri, Pelatia ni Yeshaia. Yeshaia yaazaala Refaia, Refaia yaazaala Arunani, Arunani yaazaala Obadia, Obadia yaazaala Shekania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shekania yaazaala omwana mulala, nga ni Shemaia. Shemaia oyo yaazaala: Hattushi, Igali, Baria, Nearia, ni Shafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nearia yaazaala abaana basatu, Elioenai, Hizikia, ni Azarikamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elioenai yaazaala abaana musanvu Hodavia, Eliashibu, Pelaia, Akkubu, Yohanani, Delaia, ni Anani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
